#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:2436
msgid "PDF Forms Filler for CF7"
msgstr "Outil de remplissage de formulaires PDF pour CF7"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:4
msgid "https://pdfformsfiller.org/"
msgstr "https://pdfformsfiller.org/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:5
msgid "Build Contact Form 7 forms from PDF forms. Get PDFs auto-filled and attached to email messages and/or website responses on form submission."
msgstr "Construisez des formulaires Contact Form 7 à partir de formulaires PDF. Obtenez des PDF remplis automatiquement et joints aux e-mails et/ou aux réponses du site lors de l’envoi du formulaire."

